00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:25.380
it but fundamentally it requires resources it&nbsp;
requires money enlisting people on your vision and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:30.660
having a very clear vision of what you want to do&nbsp;
and how you want that to interact with the world&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:39.420
so I would say it it obviously it starts&nbsp;
with a good story you then have to have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:47.700
resources or people contributing resources&nbsp;
to that but it is it's certainly not easy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:56.340
and so it it takes a lot of determination and&nbsp;
gusto to keep it moving so it sounds like each&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:59.520
project that you've worked on because you have&nbsp;
quite a few under your belt or that you've been&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:05.100
a part of is different each time yeah every every&nbsp;
project that comes together is is a bit different&nbsp;&nbsp;

