and usually it takes a tremendous amount of&nbsp;
I guess me believing in myself that we can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.740 --> 00:01:21.960
pull something off even when it looks&nbsp;
like the odds are stacked against us&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.660 --> 00:01:30.060
there's been projects where we were a week away&nbsp;
from filming and we didn't have all the money&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:37.320
to finish filming and it was just we'll get there&nbsp;
we'll figure it out and then we were able to close&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:45.780
the financing last week of filming at least for me&nbsp;
there's always a strong sense in which like things&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.780 --> 00:01:52.500
